  "verdict": "pass",
  "summary": "The concept shows every element the prompt names in the brief's colors, in a clean A-pose with flat lighting and blocky single-bone limbs that suit the 5,000 face_limit. Only minor notes remain.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "check": "color",
      "severity": "minor",
      "observation": "The harness reads as a redder brown (#623632) than Saddle Leather's dark reddish-brown (#4A2A10), and the belt buckle is a lighter mauve-brown. It is within tolerance and reads as leather.",
      "evidence": "assets/manifests/judge_replays/control_levy_concept3/judge/concept-1/01_concept.png (chest straps, waist belt); assertion 'palette color present: Saddle Leather' (15.3 of 25)"
    },
    {
      "check": "missing",
      "severity": "minor",
      "observation": "The prompt says the straps cross the chest and back. The image is front-only, so the back crossing can't be confirmed. The multiview stage will show it.",
      "evidence": "assets/manifests/judge_replays/control_levy_concept3/judge/concept-1/01_concept.png"
    },
    {
      "check": "malformed",
      "severity": "minor",
      "observation": "The pelvis has small open holes (the obturator gaps below the belt), and the lumbar spine is a thin column. Both are small and partly covered by the belt. The limbs are single blocky bones, the ribs are painted onto a solid chest volume, and the hands are mitten-like with no separate fingers. None of this is too fine for the face_limit.",
      "evidence": "assets/manifests/judge_replays/control_levy_concept3/judge/concept-1/01_concept.png (pelvis, waist)"
    }
  ],
  "questions_answered": [
    "All present: Old Bone skeleton; peat-brown staining at the elbows, wrists, knees, ankles and hips; readable skull; readable ribcage; Saddle Leather waist belt; two straps crossing the chest. The back crossing can't be seen because the view is front-only.",
    "Nothing is malformed or too fine. Each limb is one bone (no paired forearm or shin bones), the hands have no separate fingers, and the ribs are painted onto a solid torso. Only the small pelvic holes are minor.",
    "Yes. It's an A-pose with the arms clear of the body, empty hands, and the full body in frame.",
    "Yes. The lighting is flat and shadowless on a plain uniform mid-grey background.",
    "Both assertions pass (Old Bone ΔE 5.4, Saddle Leather ΔE 15.3). No brief color is missing and there are no large off-brief areas. Blackened Iron and Signal Red aren't expected on this base mesh."
  ],
  "images_seen": [
    "assets/manifests/judge_replays/control_levy_concept3/judge/concept-1/01_concept.png"
  ]
}
